\instorder sets an order for the instruments, meant for
sending data to the LiveLily-part programs.
Its syntax is the following:

\instorder \inst2 \inst1 \inst3

All the instruments must be given, otherwise it throws an
error.

Note that at the moment this order is only stored. It
doesn't change the order of the staves on the score, which
follows the order of \insts.init.
